  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a wood-fired oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a blender, combine ancho chillies, fish sauce, lime juice, brown sugar, garlic, and ginger, and blend until smooth.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the chilli mixture and vegetable oil.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated chicken onto the bamboo skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Season the skewers with salt and black pepper.",
    "Place the skewers in the wood-fired oven and bake for 12-15 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with fresh cilantro and lime wedges.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving."
